  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to tap the might that lurks within the absence of everything, invoking alterations to reality where your powers could not normally flow.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Two other metapsionic feats</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When manifesting a power, you may expend your psionic focus and spend 8 additional power points to make the power a vacuous power. Vacuous powers can be manifested even in the area of a null psionics field and cannot be dispelled by dispel psionics<sup>UP</sup> or similar effects. However, use of the aura alteration<sup>UP</sup> power, the break enchantment spell, or similar effects can dispel a vacuous power as if it were subjected to dispel psionics. You cannot exceed your manifester level with the number of power points spent on this power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
